{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Fokasu 是一款從兒童視角出發的視覺化專注計時工具，協助 5 至 12 歲以上的孩子理解時間、建立日常作息，並在愉快鼓勵中完成功課與家務。它適合希望孩子自行掌握專注節奏的家長，對專注力不足或自閉症譜系的孩子同樣友善。原價 US $0.99，現正於 App Store 限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>視覺計時與專注夥伴</h2>\n<p>內建 5 種視覺計時風格，包括圓環、圓餅圖、路徑與 3D 島嶼，把抽象時間化成看得見的進度。兒童版番茄鐘採用小朋友能承受的專注區間，配合溫和引導休息。8 位動畫專注夥伴會做出正面情緒反應，並可自訂裝扮，另備作息建立器、休息卡、星星獎勵與 21 種環境音效。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-334-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-335-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-336-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-337-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-338-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-339-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Fokasu: Pomodoro for Kids</li>\n<li>應用類別：Education</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-14T08:30:06.439290+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":341,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}